      ],
      "source": "https://wvexplorer.com/travel/attractions/prehistoric/mount-carbon-stone-walls/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Archaeologists believe the ancient stone walls in Mount Carbon may have had ritualistic or ceremonial significance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
