      ],
      "source": "https://wvexplorer.com/travel/attractions/prehistoric/mount-carbon-stone-walls/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The purpose of the aboriginal stone walls found in Mount Carbon remains unknown to this day.",
